      "title": "Order detail readable by any logged-in user",
      "description": "order_detail looks up the order by primary key alone and never checks the owner. The redeem view filters by owner, but order_detail does not. Any logged-in user can walk order ids and read other customers' totals and discount codes. Add owner=request.user to the get_object_or_404 lookup, as redeem already does.",
      "suggested_change": "    order = get_object_or_404(Order, pk=order_id, owner=request.user)",
      "source": null,
      "candidate": null,
      "notes": [],
      "problem": "order_detail looks up the order by primary key alone and never checks the owner. The redeem view filters by owner, but order_detail does not.",
      "consequence": "Any logged-in user can walk order ids and read other customers' totals and discount codes.",
      "fix": "Add owner=request.user to the get_object_or_404 lookup, as redeem already does."
    },
    {
      "origin": "agent",
