      "title": "New model field has no migration",
      "description": "The change adds discount_code to Order but adds no migration. The only migration, 0001_initial, creates no discount_code column. Django selects discount_code in every Order query, so the database raises a missing-column error. The list, detail and redeem endpoints all fail. Run makemigrations and commit the new migration that adds discount_code to Order.",
